      "judgment": {
        "case_id": "body40-fixed3-20261005",
        "pair_id": "pair-001-0",
        "pair_input_sha256": "06242f15ba9cee30ca6e614cb62e79ddce70a816ab70e10bcaa6a90fc23bde76",
        "assessment_state": "complete",
        "winner": "right",
        "reason": "The only substantive text change replaces an unsupported causal claim about PPI-related microbiome remodeling with an association claim. P0289 directly supports an observational PFS association but explicitly limits causal interpretation. The right side therefore improves scientific calibration and keeps the P0289 citation and mechanism context; the line remains slightly under-qualified about the proposed mechanism, so the gain is real but bounded.",
        "knowledge_preservation": "preserved",
        "resolved_issues": [
          {
            "kind": "scientific",
            "affected_side": "right",
            "target_quote": "此外，其他宿主因素的作用机制亦提示了校正的复杂性：例如，PPIs通过改变胃内pH值促进口腔细菌易位至肠道，这种由药物诱导的生态重塑与PFS的缩短存在显著关联[ P0289 ]。",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "P0289"
            ],
            "reason": "P0289 is an observational SCRUM-Japan MONSTAR-SCREEN cohort (817 pre-treatment patients; 333 ICI-treated patients, 16S rRNA profiling and adjusted association analyses). Its supplied findings report an association between oral-bacteria abundance and shorter PFS, while the PPI interaction is only suggestive (P=0.08); its stated limits say the design cannot establish causality. Therefore “存在显著关联” preserves the supported direction and claim boundary, whereas “直接导致” overstates the material.",
            "severity": "major",
            "knowledge_loss": false
          }
        ],
        "regressions": [
          {
            "kind": "scientific",
            "affected_side": "left",
            "target_quote": "此外，其他宿主因素的作用机制亦提示了校正的复杂性：例如，PPIs通过改变胃内pH值促进口腔细菌易位至肠道，这种由药物诱导的生态重塑直接导致了PFS的缩短[ P0289 ]。",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "P0289"
            ],
            "reason": "The left sentence turns P0289’s observational association into direct PFS causation, contrary to the supplied study design and limits.",
            "severity": "major",
            "knowledge_loss": false
          }
        ],
        "remaining_issues": [
          {
            "kind": "scientific",
            "affected_side": "right",
            "target_quote": "此外，其他宿主因素的作用机制亦提示了校正的复杂性：例如，PPIs通过改变胃内pH值促进口腔细菌易位至肠道，这种由药物诱导的生态重塑与PFS的缩短存在显著关联[ P0289 ]。",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "P0289"
            ],
            "reason": "The association wording is the substantive improvement, but the surrounding mechanism phrase “由药物诱导” still reads more definite than this observational card supports. P0289 presents the PPI-to-oral-bacteria pathway as a potential mechanism and warns that causal inference is not available; a later edit should qualify it as a proposed mechanism if the sentence remains.",
            "severity": "minor",
            "knowledge_loss": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "candidate_outcome": "better"
    },
